(7501778, 1195497, 83149, '<td valign="top">Great job with the dogs barking, but overall there are too many distractions in the image. The blue in the foreground, the rug on the floor, the multiple colours in the wood take away from the image.  This might actually be much better in black and white, as it would lessen those things.<br/> <br/>I think it would be better composition if it was shot from slightly more to the right and a little lower.</td>', 'Great job with the dogs barking, but overall there are too many distractions in the image. The blue in the foreground, the rug on the floor, the multiple colours in the wood take away from the image.  This might actually be much better in black and white, as it would lessen those things. I think it would be better composition if it was shot from slightly more to the right and a little lower.', '2017-02-22 21:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
