(7502453, 1195694, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is a nice one, but there was a photo you took of crows - few years ago.   I keep looking for that shot, everywhere I go.  In fact, I just looked for it in your portfolio.  Did not find it but it sure was a lot of fun poking around.</td>', 'This is a nice one, but there was a photo you took of crows - few years ago.   I keep looking for that shot, everywhere I go.  In fact, I just looked for it in your portfolio.  Did not find it but it sure was a lot of fun poking around.', '2017-02-27 02:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
